Shogo: Mobile Armor Division recomp

The host's module loader is derived from the Unreal Tournament recomp
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/ut99-recomp), the layout from the Crazy Taxi
recomp, and it runs on pcrecomp's native32 runtime
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp), all MIT.

Shogo: Mobile Armor Division and LithTech are (c) Monolith Productions. No
part of the game is included.
